! Layer-2 control examples
vtp mode transparent
spanning-tree mode pvst
spanning-tree extend system-id
!
vlan 30
 name CACHE-SERVERS
!
interface GigabitEthernet5/1
 description LAB-CACHE-SERVER-01
 switchport
 switchport mode access
 switchport access vlan 30
 spanning-tree portfast
!
! Optional Rapid-PVST+ lab variant; use only if supported by exact platform.
! spanning-tree mode rapid-pvst
!
! Enable BPDU Guard only after confirming edge-port role and platform support:
! interface GigabitEthernet5/1
!  spanning-tree bpduguard enable
